  3. <span class="t-yellow">[CLIENT PROJECT]</span> <span class="t-cyan">Dr. Muhammad Hassan BDS (Healthcare)</span>
     Live: <a href="https://hassanbds.info" target="_blank" class="t-green">https://hassanbds.info</a>
     Code: <a href="https://github.com/hashirahmad806/Hassan_Web" target="_blank" class="t-muted">github.com/hashirahmad806/Hassan_Web</a>

  4. <span class="t-yellow">[CONTENT APP]</span> <span class="t-cyan">QuickBlog Engine</span>
     Live: <a href="https://quick-blogs-i4xh.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="t-green">https://quick-blogs-i4xh.vercel.app/</a>
     Code: <a href="https://github.com/hashirahmad806/Quick-Blogs" target="_blank" class="t-muted">github.com/hashirahmad806/Quick-Blogs</a>`,
      client: `Client Work Portfolio:
  * <span class="t-cyan">Triostepdekhyaber</span>: Luxury footwear e-commerce platform -&gt; <a href="https://triostepdkhyber.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="t-green">triostepdkhyber.vercel.app</a>
  * <span class="t-cyan">Dr. Muhammad Hassan BDS</span>: Dental healthcare clinic platform -&gt; <a href="https://hassanbds.info" target="_blank" class="t-green">hassanbds.info</a>`,
      repos: `Featured Repositories (42 total):
  * <span class="t-cyan">Web_Projectect_Ai_Assistant</span> [AI Tutor / React / Vite] -&gt; <a href="https://web-projectect-ai-assistant-x8xz.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="t-green">web-projectect-ai-assistant.vercel.app</a>
  * <span class="t-cyan">triostepdkhyber</span>             [Client Project / Astro v6]  -&gt; <a href="https://triostepdkhyber.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="t-green">triostepdkhyber.vercel.app</a>
  * <span class="t-cyan">Hassan_Web</span>                  [Client Dental / MERN Stack] -&gt; <a href="https://hassanbds.info" target="_blank" class="t-green">hassanbds.info</a>
